[{"caseId":"20091019000002","caseName":"南關里東及右先方遺址","assetsClassifyCode":"2.1.2","assetsClassifyName":"直轄市定考古遺址","judgeCriteria":["遺址在文化發展脈絡中之定位及意義性","遺址文化堆積內涵之特殊性及豐富性","同類型遺址數量之稀有性"],"registerReason":"(一)「南關里東遺址」為南科園區最早的遺址之一，內涵豐富，保存環境佳，具有文化代表性及文化資產價值。\r\n(二)「右先方遺址」保存台灣新石器時代中期牛稠子文化完整資料，內容豐富，具文化期相之代表性，及文化資產價值。","lawsReference":"文化資產保存法第40條","govInstitutionName":"臺南市政府","addresses":[{"itemNo":1,"cityName":"臺南市","distName":"善化區","address":"臺南市善化區南關里"}],"longitude":120.281111,"latitude":23.116666,"representImage":{"ext":"jpg","transform":{"c":"https://data.boch.gov.tw/old_upload/_upload/Assets_new/archeology/43554/photo/f511ccc9-f9fe-4ca3-a638-dba7ec5c92cf_c.jpg"},"original":"https://data.boch.gov.tw/old_upload/_upload/Assets_new/archeology/43554/photo/f511ccc9-f9fe-4ca3-a638-dba7ec5c92cf.jpg","name":"f511ccc9-f9fe-4ca3-a638-dba7ec5c92cf"},"representImageSource":"中央研究院歷史語言研究所.國立台灣史前文化博物館提供","landScope":"臺南市善化區善科段62-0、63-0、73-0、74-0、75-0、76-0、65-0、66-0、71-0、72-0、78-0、79-0、80-0、81-0、82-0、83-0、84-0、85-0、86-0、87-0、106-0、114-0、119-0、129-0、120-0等25筆地號。「南關里東遺址」位於南科園區東北角環東路東側、水一高架水塔南側。「右先方遺址」位於青暉農場西側，南側為一埤塘，東南側為水利會灌溉渠。","nearbyArcheologyCheck":"位於或鄰近列冊遺址","nearbyArcheologyBrief":"南關里遺址(鄰近南關里東遺址)\r\n東經120º16\u002735”；北緯23º6\u002758”\r\n2 ºTM：E175869×N2557325m\r\n位於南科園區專4用地西南側，現今為奇美LCM廠。全區地勢平坦，文化層所在土質屬砂頁岩沖積砂壤土，至下層轉為砂、壤土互層。大坌坑文化菓葉類型（約4800~4200B.P.）\r\n\r\n右先方南貳遺址(鄰近右先方遺址)\r\n東經120º16\u002754”；北緯23º6\u002748”\r\n2 ºTM：E176429×N2557015m\r\n現今位於南科專11事業用地之東側、中強光電廠區以北。北側及西側為水利會灌溉渠流經，南側發掘時見一淤積河道，擬注入堤塘港。地勢平坦，土質上層為砂頁岩沖積砂壤土，下層則為沖積坋壤土。遺址共見有二層史前文化遺留，上層烏山頭遺留高程約在海拔4公尺左右，而下層大湖期遺留分布深度約在海拔3.4公尺左右，遺留密度較低。","cultralMean":"(一)南關里東遺址：\r\n1.遺址保存環境極佳，木質、植物等標本亦能保存下來，且因 埋藏深，幾未被破壞。\r\n2.文化內涵豐富，臺灣少數具有貝器工業資料者。\r\n3.面積大，為同類型遺址中面積最大者。\r\n4.見有多層文化遺留。\r\n(二)右先方遺址：\r\n1.遺址面積廣大。\r\n2.石器工業發達，大量稜柱狀磨石、廢料出土。\r\n3.與南關里東遺址可代表南科園區史前時代早期文化內涵。","pastHistory":"(一)南關里東遺址：\r\n1.2002/09/18臺南科學工業園區道爺遺址未劃入保存區部份搶救考古計劃監測發現。\r\n2.2002/09/19~2003/01/24臺南科學工業園區道爺遺址未劃入保存區部份搶救考古計畫搶救發掘。\r\n(二)右先方遺址：\r\n1.2001/3/31臺南科學工業園區道爺遺址未劃入保存區部份搶救考古計劃鑽探發現。\r\n2.2001/08/28~2002/01/15高速鐵路南科段右先方遺址搶救計畫第一次搶救（高鐵路權）。\r\n3.2005/9/13~2005/10/27南部科學工業園區考古遺址搶救監測後續計畫第二次搶救發掘（減振工程）。","actualStatus":"(一)管理人1：南部科學工業園區管理局。\r\n臺南市善化區善科段62-0、63-0、74-0、75-0、65-0、71-0、72-0、79-0、81-0、83-0、84-0、86-0、87-0、106-0、114-0、129-0、等16筆地號。\r\n(二)管理人2：交通部高速鐵路工程局。\r\n臺南市善化區善科段73-0、76-0、66-0、78-0、80-0、82-0、85-0、119-0、120-0等9筆地號。","usageStatus":"現地保存，由南部科學工業園區管理局及交通部高速鐵路工程局管理。","landUsage":"(一)南關里東遺址位於水1、公4、公5及公14用地內。\r\n(二)右先方遺址上方現規劃為綠地、公園、停車場、高鐵路線。","announcementList":[{"classification":"指定/登錄","officialDocNo":"府文資字第0980252232A號.B號","registerDate":"2009-10-19 12:02:26.0"}],"landlotList":[{"itemNo":1,"cityName":"臺南市","distName":"善化區","landNo":"善科段","landSerialNo":"62-0地號","landownership":"","cityLandUseTypeOther":"","noncityLandUseTypeOther":""},{"itemNo":2,"cityName":"臺南市","distName":"善化區","landNo":"善科段","landSerialNo":"63-0地號","landownership":"","cityLandUseTypeOther":"","noncityLandUseTypeOther":""},{"itemNo":3,"cityName":"臺南市","distName":"善化區","landNo":"善科段","landSerialNo":"65-0地號","landownership":"","cityLandUseTypeOther":"","noncityLandUseTypeOther":""},{"itemNo":4,"cityName":"臺南市","distName":"善化區","landNo":"善科段","landSerialNo":"66-0地號","landownership":"","cityLandUseTypeOther":"","noncityLandUseTypeOther":""},{"itemNo":5,"cityName":"臺南市","distName":"善化區","landNo":"善科段","landSerialNo":"71-0地號","landownership":"","cityLandUseTypeOther":"","noncityLandUseTypeOther":""},{"itemNo":6,"cityName":"臺南市","distName":"善化區","landNo":"善科段","landSerialNo":"72-0地號","landownership":"","cityLandUseTypeOther":"","noncityLandUseTypeOther":""},{"itemNo":7,"cityName":"臺南市","distName":"善化區","landNo":"善科段","landSerialNo":"73-0地號","landownership":"","cityLandUseTypeOther":"","noncityLandUseTypeOther":""},{"itemNo":8,"cityName":"臺南市","distName":"善化區","landNo":"善科段","landSerialNo":"74-0地號","landownership":"","cityLandUseTypeOther":"","noncityLandUseTypeOther":""},{"itemNo":9,"cityName":"臺南市","distName":"善化區","landNo":"善科段","landSerialNo":"75-0地號","landownership":"","cityLandUseTypeOther":"","noncityLandUseTypeOther":""},{"itemNo":10,"cityName":"臺南市","distName":"善化區","landNo":"善科段","landSerialNo":"76-0地號","landownership":"","cityLandUseTypeOther":"","noncityLandUseTypeOther":""},{"itemNo":11,"cityName":"臺南市","distName":"善化區","landNo":"善科段","landSerialNo":"78-0地號","landownership":"","cityLandUseTypeOther":"","noncityLandUseTypeOther":""},{"itemNo":12,"cityName":"臺南市","distName":"善化區","landNo":"善科段","landSerialNo":"79-0地號","landownership":"","cityLandUseTypeOther":"","noncityLandUseTypeOther":""},{"itemNo":13,"cityName":"臺南市","distName":"善化區","landNo":"善科段","landSerialNo":"80-0地號","landownership":"","cityLandUseTypeOther":"","noncityLandUseTypeOther":""},{"itemNo":14,"cityName":"臺南市","distName":"善化區","landNo":"善科段","landSerialNo":"81-0地號","landownership":"","cityLandUseTypeOther":"","noncityLandUseTypeOther":""},{"itemNo":15,"cityName":"臺南市","distName":"善化區","landNo":"善科段","landSerialNo":"82-0地號","landownership":"","cityLandUseTypeOther":"","noncityLandUseTypeOther":""},{"itemNo":16,"cityName":"臺南市","distName":"善化區","landNo":"善科段","landSerialNo":"83-0地號","landownership":"","cityLandUseTypeOther":"","noncityLandUseTypeOther":""},{"itemNo":17,"cityName":"臺南市","distName":"善化區","landNo":"善科段","landSerialNo":"84-0地號","landownership":"","cityLandUseTypeOther":"","noncityLandUseTypeOther":""},{"itemNo":18,"cityName":"臺南市","distName":"善化區","landNo":"善科段","landSerialNo":"85-0地號","landownership":"","cityLandUseTypeOther":"","noncityLandUseTypeOther":""},{"itemNo":19,"cityName":"臺南市","distName":"善化區","landNo":"善科段","landSerialNo":"86-0地號","landownership":"","cityLandUseTypeOther":"","noncityLandUseTypeOther":""},{"itemNo":20,"cityName":"臺南市","distName":"善化區","landNo":"善科段","landSerialNo":"87-0地號","landownership":"","cityLandUseTypeOther":"","noncityLandUseTypeOther":""},{"itemNo":21,"cityName":"臺南市","distName":"善化區","landNo":"善科段","landSerialNo":"106-0地號","landownership":"","cityLandUseTypeOther":"","noncityLandUseTypeOther":""},{"itemNo":22,"cityName":"臺南市","distName":"善化區","landNo":"善科段","landSerialNo":"114-0地號","landownership":"","cityLandUseTypeOther":"","noncityLandUseTypeOther":""},{"itemNo":23,"cityName":"臺南市","distName":"善化區","landNo":"善科段","landSerialNo":"119-0地號","landownership":"","cityLandUseTypeOther":"","noncityLandUseTypeOther":""},{"itemNo":24,"cityName":"臺南市","distName":"善化區","landNo":"善科段","landSerialNo":"120-0地號","landownership":"","cityLandUseTypeOther":"","noncityLandUseTypeOther":""},{"itemNo":25,"cityName":"臺南市","distName":"善化區","landNo":"善科段","landSerialNo":"129-0地號","landownership":"","cityLandUseTypeOther":"","noncityLandUseTypeOther":""}],"caseUrl":"http://nchdb.boch.gov.tw/assets/advanceSearch/archaeologicalSite/20091019000002","mediaImageList":[{"mediaName":"f511ccc9-f9fe-4ca3-a638-dba7ec5c92cf","url":"https://data.boch.gov.tw/old_upload/_upload/Assets_new/archeology/43602/photo/f511ccc9-f9fe-4ca3-a638-dba7ec5c92cf.jpg"}],"documents":["https://data.boch.gov.tw/upload/documents/2021-06-28/1f94f24a-abc9-4e54-932d-256b374161ba/公告-P3.jpeg","https://data.boch.gov.tw/upload/documents/2021-06-28/3d7c2b8d-bcda-4d4b-9dcf-473fe405d98e/公告-P2.jpeg","https://data.boch.gov.tw/upload/documents/2021-06-28/eb35c2ee-c75f-468c-ac83-98584e308349/公告-P1.jpeg"],"caseOwnership":[{"ownerType":"土地所有人","ownerName":"中華民國"}],"govInstitution":"臺南市文化資產管理處","govDeptName":"有形文化資產組","govDeptAddress":"臺南市中西區中正路五巷一號3F","govDeptPhone":"06-2213569、06-2213597、06-2210750、06-2217052","repImgId":4528},{"caseId":"20091019000003","caseName":"旗竿地遺址","assetsClassifyCode":"2.1.2","assetsClassifyName":"直轄市定考古遺址","judgeCriteria":["遺址在文化發展脈絡中之定位及意義性","遺址文化堆積內涵之特殊性及豐富性","同類型遺址數量之稀有性","遺址保存狀況之完整性"],"registerReason":"「旗竿地遺址」據有烏山頭期、蔦松期與近代漢人遺留等文化層，保存良好，具代表性。","lawsReference":"文化資產保存法第40條","govInstitutionName":"臺南市政府","addresses":[{"itemNo":1,"cityName":"臺南市","distName":"新市區","address":"新市區豐華里.善化區南關里"}],"longitude":120.254722,"latitude":23.103611,"representImage":{"ext":"jpg","transform":{"c":"https://data.boch.gov.tw/old_upload/_upload/Assets_new/archeology/32584/photo/8cf9d444-12b1-49e2-83ee-306699f5c967_c.jpg"},"original":"https://data.boch.gov.tw/old_upload/_upload/Assets_new/archeology/32584/photo/8cf9d444-12b1-49e2-83ee-306699f5c967.jpg","name":"8cf9d444-12b1-49e2-83ee-306699f5c967"},"representImageSource":"中央研究院歷史語言研究所.國立台灣史前文化博物館提供","landScope":"臺南市新市區新晶段23-2、25-0、43-0、26-0、30-0等5筆地號","nearbyArcheologyCheck":"位於或鄰近列冊遺址","nearbyArcheologyBrief":"旗竿地東遺址：\r\n東經120º15\u002729”；北緯23º6\u00275”\r\n2 ºTM：E173984×N2555715m\r\n位於看西排水溝及木柵港匯流處之南側，現屬奇美材料科技公司廠房內。地勢平坦，上層為砂頁岩沖積砂壤土，下層為砂頁岩坋壤土。\r\n大湖文化魚寮類型／蔦松文化蔦松類型／近代漢人文化\r\n （約2000~1800／1400~1000／\u003c300B.P.）","cultralMean":"1.同時具兩層不同時期之考古文化。\r\n2.遺址中蔦松類型為晚期類型，出現頻率低，且遺留豐富，具期相代表性。","pastHistory":"1.2000年台南科學工業園區特定區計畫案史前文化遺址調查計畫調查發現。\r\n2.2005/05月南科液晶電視及產業支援工業區開發計畫考古鑽探計畫鑽探\r\n3.2007/1/3~2007/4/10南科液晶電視及產業支援工業區考古遺址受開發影響部份搶救發掘計畫搶救發掘工業用地部分。","actualStatus":"廣場用地現地保留，規劃為停車場，現已完成填土。其餘為綠地及道路覆蓋。","usageStatus":"1.廣場用地現地保存。\r\n2.曼陀林路及綠1用地除管線工程外，應未破壞下層考古遺留。\r\n3.廣停8用地以東業經搶救。\r\n4.南133道路以北公滯1用地中，部分原為魚塭用地已受破壞，其餘屬滯洪池邊坡，未造成破壞。","landUsage":"廣場用地現地保留，規劃為停車場，現已完成填土。其餘為綠地及道路覆蓋。","announcementList":[{"classification":"指定/登錄","officialDocNo":"府文資字第0980252232A號、B號","registerDate":"2009-10-19 15:36:41.0"}],"landlotList":[{"itemNo":1,"cityName":"臺南市","distName":"新市區","landNo":"新晶段","landSerialNo":"23-2地號","landownership":"","cityLandUseTypeOther":"","noncityLandUseTypeOther":""},{"itemNo":2,"cityName":"臺南市","distName":"新市區","landNo":"新晶段","landSerialNo":"25-0地號","landownership":"","cityLandUseTypeOther":"","noncityLandUseTypeOther":""},{"itemNo":3,"cityName":"臺南市","distName":"新市區","landNo":"新晶段","landSerialNo":"26-0地號","landownership":"","cityLandUseTypeOther":"","noncityLandUseTypeOther":""},{"itemNo":4,"cityName":"臺南市","distName":"新市區","landNo":"新晶段","landSerialNo":"30-0地號","landownership":"","cityLandUseTypeOther":"","noncityLandUseTypeOther":""},{"itemNo":5,"cityName":"臺南市","distName":"新市區","landNo":"新晶段","landSerialNo":"43-0地號","landownership":"","cityLandUseTypeOther":"","noncityLandUseTypeOther":""}],"caseUrl":"http://nchdb.boch.gov.tw/assets/advanceSearch/archaeologicalSite/20091019000003","documents":["https://data.boch.gov.tw/upload/documents/2021-06-28/4795f2d0-fa3e-4644-907d-fb777c34fb73/公告-P3.jpeg","https://data.boch.gov.tw/upload/documents/2021-06-28/08368c96-6b2f-4bb2-8dae-14c94c032ed8/公告-P2.jpeg","https://data.boch.gov.tw/upload/documents/2021-06-28/49fc8bf0-b57b-4a49-a5c2-d880e7281ac2/公告-P1.jpeg"],"caseOwnership":[{"ownerType":"土地所有人","ownerName":"中華民國"}],"govInstitution":"臺南市文化資產管理處","govDeptName":"有形文化資產組","govDeptAddress":"臺南市中西區中正路五巷一號3F","govDeptPhone":"06-2213569、06-2213597、06-2210750、06-2217052","repImgId":4529},{"caseId":"20060502000001","caseName":"道爺古墓","assetsClassifyCode":"2.1.2","assetsClassifyName":"直轄市定考古遺址","judgeCriteria":["遺址在文化發展脈絡中之定位及意義性","遺址在學術研究史上意義性","遺址文化堆積內涵之特殊性及豐富性","同類型遺址數量之稀有性","遺址保存狀況之完整性","遺址供展示教育規劃之適當性","具其他遺址價值者"],"registerReason":"具有「遺址指定及廢止審查辦法」第3條指定之基準","lawsReference":"文化資產保存法第40條","govInstitutionName":"臺南市政府","addresses":[{"itemNo":1,"cityName":"臺南市","distName":"新市區","address":"臺南市新市區"}],"longitude":120.277247,"latitude":23.096983,"relativePosition":"南科園區第一高架水塔北側","neighborPosition":"南科園區第一高架水塔","representImage":{"ext":"jpg","transform":{"c":"https://data.boch.gov.tw/upload/representImageFile/2025-06-23/55d9898d-6ba9-42dc-9365-252db8462ed8/考古遺址002道爺古墓遺址_P003_c.jpg"},"original":"https://data.boch.gov.tw/upload/representImageFile/2025-06-23/55d9898d-6ba9-42dc-9365-252db8462ed8/考古遺址002道爺古墓遺址_P003.jpg","name":"考古遺址002道爺古墓遺址_P003"},"representImageSource":"臺南市政府","landScope":"臺南市新市區道爺段927-4地號；道爺古墓本體。","nearbyArcheologyCheck":"位於或鄰近列冊遺址","nearbyArcheologyBrief":"道爺古墓位居台南市新市區道爺遺址範圍內,道爺遺址位於新市區豐華里,西鄰柑港.南接堤塘港,北端靠近西拉雅大道及其向西延伸線,東端則到達石頭埔,即新市區第十公墓。","cultralMean":"此墓葬規制完整，具有歷史教育價值，且墓址位於南科園區，應可使科技與人文有良好的結合與對話，對於人文與科技的平衡發展與表現有其價值，故值得指定為遺址。","pastHistory":"墓塋建成後遭湮沒，湮沒年代不詳，至民國88年元月因道爺遺址搶救發掘始重新出土。","actualStatus":"墓碑已佚失，墓塚已堆平，土槨上部受耕作破壞部份，棺內骨骸及棺木於發現時已遭擾亂，發掘過程另行取出保存。目前以鐵皮屋搭蓋遮光保護，防止雜草蔓延。","usageStatus":"「道爺古墓」，所有人為國有，土地管理者為南部科學工業園區管理局。","landUsage":"現地保存，由南部科學工業園區管理局管理。","announcementList":[{"classification":"指定/登錄","officialDocNo":"府文資字第0950092107","registerDate":"2006-05-02 10:31:17.0"}],"landlotList":[{"itemNo":1,"cityName":"臺南市","distName":"新市區","landNo":"道爺段","landSerialNo":"927-4地號","landownership":"","cityLandUseTypeOther":"","noncityLandUseTypeOther":""}],"caseUrl":"http://nchdb.boch.gov.tw/assets/advanceSearch/archaeologicalSite/20060502000001","mediaImageList":[{"mediaName":"道爺古墓1","description":"109年委託博典拍攝，114年上傳。","url":"https://data.boch.gov.tw/upload/media/2025-06-23/80b3100c-22ea-41bf-b656-0a2c1cc85b76/考古遺址002道爺古墓遺址_P001.jpg"},{"mediaName":"道爺古墓2","description":"109年委託博典拍攝，114年上傳。","url":"https://data.boch.gov.tw/upload/media/2025-06-23/0a9b90e3-3422-4771-b332-f28fe9cbc0ac/考古遺址002道爺古墓遺址_P002.jpg"},{"mediaName":"道爺古墓3","description":"109年委託博典拍攝，114年上傳。","url":"https://data.boch.gov.tw/upload/media/2025-06-23/32a89336-9154-467e-874f-49f58c6e210f/考古遺址002道爺古墓遺址_P003.jpg"},{"mediaName":"道爺古墓4","description":"109年委託博典拍攝，114年上傳。","url":"https://data.boch.gov.tw/upload/media/2025-06-23/a9e4a6d9-40c5-4ca5-bdba-524ab0c4cfb7/考古遺址002道爺古墓遺址_P004.jpg"},{"mediaName":"道爺古墓5","description":"109年委託博典拍攝，114年上傳。","url":"https://data.boch.gov.tw/upload/media/2025-06-23/41d7f308-d6cf-4feb-ab60-001b93f664ce/考古遺址002道爺古墓遺址_P005.jpg"},{"mediaName":"道爺古墓6","description":"109年委託博典拍攝，114年上傳。","url":"https://data.boch.gov.tw/upload/media/2025-06-23/8995e308-7acd-41a0-b018-7923ed5d9f94/考古遺址002道爺古墓遺址_P006.jpg"},{"mediaName":"道爺古墓7","description":"109年委託博典拍攝，114年上傳。","url":"https://data.boch.gov.tw/upload/media/2025-06-23/74e60da4-ca39-4706-a97d-fd557dba0189/考古遺址002道爺古墓遺址_P007.jpg"},{"mediaName":"道爺古墓8","description":"109年委託博典拍攝，114年上傳。","url":"https://data.boch.gov.tw/upload/media/2025-06-23/7c0de3c1-c498-4b29-836d-1838eb75b718/考古遺址002道爺古墓遺址_P008.jpg"}],"documents":["https://data.boch.gov.tw/upload/documents/2021-06-28/b7ed9d1e-df5d-4b79-8676-b0c9540c385c/道爺古墓.道爺南糖部遺址.麻豆水堀頭遺址公告-P.5.jpeg","https://data.boch.gov.tw/upload/documents/2021-06-28/9b15b2da-9920-4499-a9a9-8c4d94bac5cd/道爺古墓.道爺南糖部遺址.麻豆水堀頭遺址公告-P.4.jpeg","https://data.boch.gov.tw/upload/documents/2021-06-28/d3235f48-6bc3-4f0c-903b-9c445e0e943a/道爺古墓.道爺南糖部遺址.麻豆水堀頭遺址公告-P.3.jpeg","https://data.boch.gov.tw/upload/documents/2021-06-28/970b01c3-28a4-4c03-bd7c-d78e26097a7e/道爺古墓.道爺南糖部遺址.麻豆水堀頭遺址公告-P.2.jpeg","https://data.boch.gov.tw/upload/documents/2021-06-28/cf941392-b387-4d26-9772-207e84b91e43/道爺古墓.道爺南糖部遺址.麻豆水堀頭遺址公告-P.1.jpeg"],"caseOwnership":[{"ownerType":"土地所有人","ownerName":"中華民國"}],"govInstitution":"臺南市文化資產管理處","govDeptName":"有形文化資產組","govDeptAddress":"臺南市中西區中正路五巷一號3F","govDeptPhone":"06-2213569、06-2213597、06-2210750、06-2217052","repImgId":288813},{"caseId":"20080103000002","caseName":"三分子日軍射擊場遺址","assetsClassifyCode":"2.1.2","assetsClassifyName":"直轄市定考古遺址","judgeCriteria":["遺址在文化發展脈絡中之定位及意義性"],"registerReason":"具歷史、文化的意義與價值，見證打靶射擊的軍事史實；且年代已近百年。","lawsReference":"文化資產保存法第四十條、遺址指定及廢止審查辦法第三、五條。","govInstitutionName":"臺南市政府","addresses":[{"itemNo":1,"cityName":"臺南市","distName":"北區","address":"臺南市北區重興里慈光十三村與自治新村之間"}],"longitude":120.22765,"latitude":23.003882,"representImage":{"ext":"jpg","transform":{"c":"https://data.boch.gov.tw/old_upload/_upload/Assets_new/archeology/32585/photo/3bfcc6dc-b8d8-4ae6-a051-bc4a134881b5_c.jpg"},"original":"https://data.boch.gov.tw/old_upload/_upload/Assets_new/archeology/32585/photo/3bfcc6dc-b8d8-4ae6-a051-bc4a134881b5.jpg","name":"3bfcc6dc-b8d8-4ae6-a051-bc4a134881b5"},"representImageSource":"臺南市政府","landScope":"仁愛段76-1靶溝向西擴展十公尺向東以牆為界及76-6向東延伸至靶溝。\n臺南市北區仁愛段76-1地號於103年4月2日逕為分割登記為76-1及76-15地號，76-1地號並於105年9月6日逕為分割登記為76-1及76-18地號，為遺址定著土地之明確性及配合地籍分割，依原公告之遺址定著土地範圍。","nearbyArcheologyCheck":"位於或鄰近普查遺址","nearbyArcheologyBrief":"鄰近並無遺址","cultralMean":"在「自治新村」拆除的過程中，社區居民極力爭取保留位於兒公用地之自治1、2號眷舍，社區透過這幾年的社區總體營造過程中所打造為「竹籬笆文化會館」，並建置「文化資產守護工作站」，將這段時間所搶救的各式有關於靶溝、軍事設施發展史、眷村意象、文物等逐一彙整，可提供作為探索靶溝遺跡及早期軍事用地變遷相關資料見證，連結做為未來相關靶溝保存區與文化資產維護管理之據點。","pastHistory":"依整個重興里之地理位置，在台南市應屬高地勢地區，又原有一座少有的高地，也就是「打靶山」，據說清領時期稱「旗兵山，山的後方有柴頭港溪流過，自古以來一直是一個軍事重地，日治時期有日軍第二聯隊駐守，戰後國軍接管設置為第四部隊三分子射擊場，沿用舊有打靶設施，故現在仍留有殘缺的日治時期靶溝遺跡。日後打靶山上的土挖去蓋高速公路，原地興建慈光十三村。藏身於自治新村內之日治時期靶溝遺跡，於九十五年十一月軍方開始拆除自治新村後已陸續呈現原貌。","actualStatus":"現地保存，由國防部僱請守護隊員進行清潔維護。","usageStatus":"藏身於自治新村內之日治時期靶溝遺址，於九十五年十一月軍方開始拆除自治新村後已陸續呈現原貌。靶溝遺構週邊（保存區）由守護隊進行清潔維護，定期清理雜草。","landUsage":"現地保存，由國防部僱請守護隊員進行清潔維護。","announcementList":[{"classification":"變更/修正","officialDocNo":"府文資處字第1051234200號","registerDate":"2016-12-05 15:19:29.839"},{"classification":"指定/登錄","officialDocNo":"南市文資字第09718500240號","registerDate":"2008-01-03 09:51:28.0"}],"landlotList":[{"itemNo":1,"cityName":"臺南市","distName":"北區","landNo":"仁愛段","landSerialNo":"76-1地號","landownership":"","cityLandUseTypeOther":"","noncityLandUseTypeOther":""},{"itemNo":2,"cityName":"臺南市","distName":"北區","landNo":"仁愛段","landSerialNo":"76-6地號","landownership":"","cityLandUseTypeOther":"","noncityLandUseTypeOther":""},{"itemNo":3,"cityName":"臺南市","distName":"北區","landNo":"仁愛段","landSerialNo":"76-15地號","landownership":"","cityLandUseTypeOther":"","noncityLandUseTypeOther":""},{"itemNo":4,"cityName":"臺南市","distName":"北區","landNo":"仁愛段","landSerialNo":"76-18地號","landownership":"","cityLandUseTypeOther":"","noncityLandUseTypeOther":""}],"caseUrl":"http://nchdb.boch.gov.tw/assets/advanceSearch/archaeologicalSite/20080103000002","mediaImageList":[{"mediaName":"三分子日軍射擊場遺址1","description":"109年委託博典拍攝，114年上傳。","url":"https://data.boch.gov.tw/upload/media/2025-06-23/0bcf35b8-5ec0-4b5e-b92d-28ef5c8b9a0b/考古遺址003三分子日軍射擊場遺址_P001.jpg"},{"mediaName":"三分子日軍射擊場遺址2","description":"109年委託博典拍攝，114年上傳。","url":"https://data.boch.gov.tw/upload/media/2025-06-23/88168b74-ad79-4339-ba53-b99b35d85fda/考古遺址003三分子日軍射擊場遺址_P002.jpg"},{"mediaName":"三分子日軍射擊場遺址3","description":"109年委託博典拍攝，114年上傳。","url":"https://data.boch.gov.tw/upload/media/2025-06-23/7a7cc908-8e3e-4e60-a8e7-a314a54e392d/考古遺址003三分子日軍射擊場遺址_P003.jpg"},{"mediaName":"三分子日軍射擊場遺址4","description":"109年委託博典拍攝，114年上傳。","url":"https://data.boch.gov.tw/upload/media/2025-06-23/99d3999d-b38a-4ea3-a60c-66c5fafde317/考古遺址003三分子日軍射擊場遺址_P004.jpg"},{"mediaName":"三分子日軍射擊場遺址5","description":"109年委託博典拍攝，114年上傳。","url":"https://data.boch.gov.tw/upload/media/2025-06-23/aecf40a0-9e31-40d6-81a4-c09052b7be9e/考古遺址003三分子日軍射擊場遺址_P005.jpg"},{"mediaName":"三分子日軍射擊場遺址6","description":"109年委託博典拍攝，114年上傳。","url":"https://data.boch.gov.tw/upload/media/2025-06-23/dfd11fa2-c2d5-4f2d-8856-bcd178a0e515/考古遺址003三分子日軍射擊場遺址_P006.jpg"},{"mediaName":"三分子日軍射擊場遺址7","description":"109年委託博典拍攝，114年上傳。","url":"https://data.boch.gov.tw/upload/media/2025-06-23/2196d6cd-f49e-4a54-9567-dd1917bb3ec6/考古遺址003三分子日軍射擊場遺址_P007.jpg"},{"mediaName":"三分子日軍射擊場遺址8","description":"109年委託博典拍攝，114年上傳。","url":"https://data.boch.gov.tw/upload/media/2025-06-23/68dd96a8-e384-4812-b0af-02368a2835c5/考古遺址003三分子日軍射擊場遺址_P008.jpg"}],"documents":["https://data.boch.gov.tw/upload/documents/2021-06-28/b4bd3ff5-3561-420c-b050-0ee34ccf1105/105_三分子補充公告.pdf","https://data.boch.gov.tw/upload/documents/2021-06-28/1f65ed77-1d82-4394-8bcf-ce13fd73673c/三分子遺址公告函.jpg"],"caseOwnership":[{"ownerType":"土地所有人","ownerName":"國防部"}],"govInstitution":"臺南市文化資產管理處","govDeptName":"文化資產研究組","govDeptAddress":"臺南市中西區中正路五巷一號3F","govDeptPhone":"06-2213569、06-2213597","repImgId":4531},{"caseId":"20060501000002","caseName":"圓山考古遺址","assetsClassifyCode":"2.1.1","assetsClassifyName":"國定考古遺址","judgeCriteria":["遺址在文化發展脈絡中之定位及意義性","遺址在學術研究史上意義性","遺址文化堆積內涵之特殊性及豐富性","同類型遺址數量之稀有性","遺址保存狀況之完整性","遺址供展示教育規劃之適當性","具其他遺址價值者"],"registerReason":"圓山為臺北盆地之獨立小丘，在臺北盆地仍為湖泊時，圓山為湖邊之小島，據日據時期之考古發掘，證實史前曾有人類活動，在山腰發現之無數貝殼，主要種類為烏蜆殼、蠔殼、鐘螺殼及川蜷螺等半鹼性和海棲性貝殼類，為史前人類食後所棄，稱為貝塚。民國四十三年〈1954年〉曾由學術單位進行發掘，發現上層有陶器、石器、骨器、及角器等出土，定名為圓山文化。但下層又發現繩紋陶，定名為繩紋陶文化，又名大坌坑文化，為臺灣較早的新石器時代文化。","lawsReference":"文化資產保存法102條(民國94年版)","govInstitutionName":"文化部","addresses":[{"itemNo":1,"cityName":"臺北市","distName":"中山區","address":"中山北路三段66號"}],"longitude":121.522531,"latitude":25.0733,"representImage":{"ext":"JPG","transform":{"c":"https://data.boch.gov.tw/old_upload/_upload/Assets_new/archeology/4438/photo/台北市圓山遺址01_c.JPG"},"original":"https://data.boch.gov.tw/old_upload/_upload/Assets_new/archeology/4438/photo/台北市圓山遺址01.JPG","name":"台北市圓山遺址01"},"representImageSource":"文化部文化資產局","landScope":"臺北市中山區德惠一小段158、159、159-1、159-2、160-4、160-8、160-9、162、169-2、169-4、176、177、178、179、180、181、182-1、183、184、185-1、186-1、187、188、189、190、191、192、193及大同區大龍段一小段259、259-12、264-3、662、662-1、664、665、666、667、669、671、674地號等40筆地號(原第一級古蹟範圍)。","nearbyArcheologyCheck":"位於或鄰近普查遺址","nearbyArcheologyBrief":"芝山岩遺址","cultralMean":"圓山遺址是台灣早期發現的史前遺址之一（1897），同時也是臺灣考古工作初期的研究的開端。根據資料本遺址至少包含了先陶時期文化/大坌坑文化/圓山文化/訊塘埔文化/十三行文化，圓山文化可以說是代表臺灣北部最重要的新石器文化。","pastHistory":"民國42年圓山遺址展開為期10天的試掘，為圓山遺址第一次正式發掘，於民國43年，台大考古人類學系與台北市文獻委員會合作進行發掘圓山遺址。民國76年的發掘發現繩紋陶文化層，並在底層岩盤上發現若干圓洞，為人工鑿成，推測可能為圓山文化時代的房屋柱洞，民國80年，台大人類學系受民政局委託，針對中山路三十三號道路進行試掘，普遍發現繩紋陶與圓山文化層。民國81年於大鵬劇校內的探坑，發現可能是屬於先陶時代的打製石器。","actualStatus":"現址為臺北市立兒童育樂中心，該處現行都市計畫為公園保留地。","usageStatus":"兒童育樂中心規劃之內含包括音樂噴泉、靜態活動區、動態活動區、集散廣場、今日世界、明日世界及昨日世界等七區，均設置於原圓山動物園區域內。","landUsage":"圓山遺址位於今臺北市立兒童育樂中心現址(前身為臺北市立圓山動物園)。","announcementList":[{"classification":"變更/修正","officialDocNo":"文授資局物字第10630129932號","registerDate":"2017-11-17 14:23:17.581","note":"重新公告類別名稱"},{"classification":"指定/登錄","officialDocNo":"文資籌研字第09500017951號","registerDate":"2006-05-01 17:19:13.0"}],"landlotList":[{"itemNo":1,"cityName":"臺北市","distName":"中山區","landNo":"德惠段一小段","landSerialNo":"158","landownership":"公有","cityLandUseType":"其他使用區","cityLandUseTypeOther":"公園用地","noncityLandUseTypeOther":""},{"itemNo":2,"cityName":"臺北市","distName":"中山區","landNo":"德惠段一小段","landSerialNo":"159","landownership":"公有","cityLandUseType":"其他使用區","cityLandUseTypeOther":"公園用地","noncityLandUseTypeOther":""},{"itemNo":3,"cityName":"臺北市","distName":"中山區","landNo":"德惠段一小段","landSerialNo":"159-1","landownership":"公有","cityLandUseType":"其他使用區","cityLandUseTypeOther":"公園用地","noncityLandUseTypeOther":""},{"itemNo":4,"cityName":"臺北市","distName":"中山區","landNo":"德惠段一小段","landSerialNo":"159-2","landownership":"公有","cityLan